This product includes software developed by All Aligned Consulting LLC
for Suggestibility.ai (https://suggestibility.ai).

Suggestibility.ai is an AI Expert Review Board: it analyses technical
artifacts through several independent model families and returns consensus,
preserved dissent, and prioritised recommendations.

This repository contains the WebMCP client surface only. It calls the
Suggestibility.ai platform API over HTTPS. The review pipeline itself --
board composition, reviewer selection, synthesis, and scoring -- is a
separate, proprietary service and is not included in this distribution.

